DDR0001  SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH is not a whole number of seconds
DDR0002  the source directory does not exist, or is not a directory
DDR0003  the first argument is not a ddraig command
DDR0004  a command was given the wrong number of arguments
DDR0005  `ddraig explain` was given an identifier that is not a diagnostic code
DDR0101  a line of a TOML file is not valid TOML
DDR0102  a TOML feature that ddraig does not read
DDR0103  a key or a table is defined twice
DDR0104  ddraig.toml has a table ddraig does not know
DDR0105  a table in ddraig.toml has a key ddraig does not know
DDR0106  a setting in ddraig.toml has the wrong kind of value
DDR0107  a setting in ddraig.toml has a value ddraig cannot use
DDR0108  a menu entry is missing its name or its url
DDR0109  a configuration file could not be read
DDR0201  a template uses a {{site...}} or {{data...}} variable that does not exist
DDR0202  a template variable holds a list, which cannot be shown as text
